        :ARG3-of (m3 / mortgage-01)
        :op1 (m2 / monetary-quantity
            :quant 200000
            :unit (d2 / dollar)))
    :condition g)

# ::tok The prime route (40% of this route) will complete an increase of some R16, assuming a further increase of 0.5% next month.
