# ::tok The index is based on a number of parameters tested by each authority, which test the authority's level of "friendliness" to businesses in its jurisdiction.
# ::node	i	index	1-2
# ::node	b	base-02	3-4
# ::node	n	number	6-7
# ::node	p	parameter	8-9
# ::node	t	test-01	9-10
# ::node	e	each	11-12
